    "ig": {
      "_comment": "What this repository is, per the content types its layers register (bean folio-assistant-cz17, follow-up b; owner card 2026-10-30T12:40Z, \"A. ig section in index.config\"). `ig`: fhir-harness's `ig` content type (fhir-harness#198); `include` is everything the harness reads in this repository, and nothing else is read (owner, 2026-10-30: \"harness desclares what it it pays attention to in the repo\"). It lists every `input/` entry the build used before the section existed, so nothing is dropped, and `local-template/`, the IG Publisher template `ig.ini` names (`template = #local-template`), whose `includes/` build-ig-site renders (`localTemplateIncludes`). sushi-config.yaml stays SUSHI's file. smart-immunizations#89 is the model.",
      "include": [
        "sushi-config.yaml",
        "ig.ini",
        "local-template/",
        "input/business-processes/",
        "input/data/",
        "input/fsh/",
        "input/ignoreWarnings.txt",
        "input/images/",
        "input/images-source/",
        "input/includes/",
        "input/maps-src/",
        "input/pagecontent/",
        "input/resources/",
        "input/scripts/",
